BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Rutina Skincare//RO
X-WR-CALNAME:Rutina Skincare
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Europe/Bucharest
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:skincare-morning-owner-v3@routine
SUMMARY:🌅 Rutina Skincare — Dimineata (5 min)
DESCRIPTION:━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌅 RUTINA DIMINEATA\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nPAS 1 — CURATARE\n🧴 CeraVe Foaming Cleanser 473ml\n→ Uda fata cu apa calduta\n→ O doza de gel\, masaza circular 60 secunde\n→ Clateste cu apa RECE (inchide porii)\n\nPAS 2 — SER\n💧 Revox Just Niacinamide 10% + Zinc 1% (30ml)\n→ 2-3 picaturi\, bate usor cu degetele pe toata fata\n→ Nu freca\, lasa 30 sec sa se absoarba\n→ Reduce sebum\, matifiaza\, reduce porii\n\nPAS 3 — OCHI\n👁️ Crema ochi cu Cafeina + Retinol + Acid Hialuronic + Vit. E (20ml)\n→ Cat un bob de orez pe inelar\n→ Tamponeza USOR sub si in jurul ochilor\n→ NU freca niciodata zona ochilor!\n→ Reduce cearcane si puffiness\n\nPAS 4 — PROTECTIE SOLARA (OBLIGATORIU!)\n☀️ Elmiplant Sensitive Sun SPF 50+ (50ml)\n→ 2 degete pline de crema\n→ Acopera toata fata\, gatul si urechile\n→ Chiar daca stai in casa — UV patrunde prin geam!
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Bucharest:20260615T051500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Bucharest:20260615T052000
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:skincare-retinol-owner-v3@routine
SUMMARY:🌙 Skincare Seara — RETINOL 🔴 (Luni/Mie/Vin)
DESCRIPTION:━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌙 RUTINA SEARA — RETINOL\n(Luni / Miercuri / Vineri)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nPAS 1 — CURATARE\n🧴 CeraVe Foaming Cleanser 473ml\n→ La fel ca dimineata\n→ Dupa\, usuca COMPLET fata cu un prosop curat\n→ ⚠️ Fata trebuie sa fie 100% uscata pentru retinol!\n\nPAS 2 — RETINOL\n💧 Revox Just Retinol in Squalane H2O-Free (30ml)\n→ 2-3 picaturi pe fata complet USCATA\n→ Aplica pe toata fata\, evita zona ochilor\n→ Masaza usor pana se absoarbe\n→ Stimuleaza colagenul\, reinnoire celulara\n\n⚠️ PRIMELE 2 SAPTAMANI: Foloseste DOAR Luni + Joi\n⚠️ Nu combina cu acizi directi (AHA/BHA) in aceeasi seara\n⚠️ Obligatoriu SPF dimineata urmatoare!\n\nPAS 3 — OCHI\n👁️ Crema ochi cu Cafeina + Retinol + Acid Hialuronic (20ml)\n→ Cat un bob de orez pe inelar\n→ Tamponeza usor sub si in jurul ochilor
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Bucharest:20260616T213000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Bucharest:20260616T213500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO,WE,FR
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:skincare-peptide-owner-v3@routine
SUMMARY:🌙 Skincare Seara — PEPTIDE 🔵 (Mar/Joi/Sam/Dum)
DESCRIPTION:━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌙 RUTINA SEARA — PEPTIDE\n(Marti / Joi / Sambata / Duminica)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nPAS 1 — CURATARE\n🧴 CeraVe Foaming Cleanser 473ml\n→ Uda fata\, masaza 60 sec\, clateste\n\nPAS 2 — SER PEPTIDE\n💧 Multi-Peptide + Peptide de Cupru 1% (30ml)\n→ 3-4 picaturi pe toata fata\n→ Include: GHK-Cu\, Matrixyl\, Argireline\, SYN-AKE\n→ Stimuleaza colagenul\, reduce riduri fine\, fermitate\n→ Se poate folosi zilnic\, fara iritatie\n\nPAS 3 — OCHI\n👁️ Crema ochi cu Cafeina + Retinol + Acid Hialuronic (20ml)\n→ Cat un bob de orez pe inelar\n→ Tamponeza USOR cu inelarul\n→ Nu freca niciodata zona ochilor!\n\n💡 SFAT: Tine crema de ochi la frigider 10 min inainte\n→ Efect racoritor care reduce instant puffiness dimineata
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Bucharest:20260617T213000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Bucharest:20260617T213500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU,TH,SA,SU
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR